1
00:00:06,830 --> 00:00:07,830
Empat puluh hari,

2
00:00:08,090 --> 00:00:09,260
pagi dan petang,

3
00:00:09,500 --> 00:00:11,840
seorang raksasa menantang bangsa Israel.

4
00:00:12,110 --> 00:00:13,280
Namanya Goliat,

5
00:00:13,630 --> 00:00:16,380
prajurit Filistin setinggi hampir tiga meter.

6
00:00:16,820 --> 00:00:19,630
Seluruh pasukan Raja Saul gemetar ketakutan.

7
00:00:20,230 --> 00:00:23,590
Sementara itu, di Betlehem, ada seorang gembala muda.

8
00:00:23,890 --> 00:00:24,370
Daud,

9
00:00:24,550 --> 00:00:25,660
anak bungsu Isai.

10
00:00:26,140 --> 00:00:28,450
Ia datang membawa bekal untuk kakak-kakaknya,

11
00:00:28,640 --> 00:00:30,400
lalu mendengar tantangan itu.

12
00:00:30,840 --> 00:00:31,690
Daud bertanya,

13
00:00:32,050 --> 00:00:33,300
“Mengapa tak ada yang berani?”

14
00:00:33,740 --> 00:00:35,330
Saul memberinya baju perang.

15
00:00:35,540 --> 00:00:36,720
Namun Daud menolak.

16
00:00:36,970 --> 00:00:38,740
Ia memilih yang ia kuasai.

17
00:00:39,090 --> 00:00:39,610
Tongkat,

18
00:00:39,820 --> 00:00:42,300
umban, dan lima batu licin dari sungai.

19
00:00:42,670 --> 00:00:43,300
Itu saja.

20
00:00:43,180 --> 00:00:44,220
Goliat mengejek.

21
00:00:44,650 --> 00:00:45,670
Tapi Daud menjawab,

22
00:00:46,010 --> 00:00:48,260
“Engkau datang dengan pedang dan tombak.

23
00:00:48,480 --> 00:00:51,170
Aku datang dengan nama TUHAN semesta alam.”

24
00:00:51,610 --> 00:00:52,650
Daud berlari.

25
00:00:52,930 --> 00:00:54,110
Umban berputar.

26
00:00:54,230 --> 00:00:55,430
Satu batu melesat.

27
00:00:55,680 --> 00:00:57,490
Batu itu mengenai dahi Goliat,

28
00:00:57,690 --> 00:00:59,490
dan raksasa itu pun tumbang.

29
00:00:59,850 --> 00:01:02,080
Pasukan Filistin lari tunggang-langgang.

30
00:01:02,620 --> 00:01:05,220
Raksasa dalam hidupmu mungkin bukan musuh.

31
00:01:05,520 --> 00:01:06,500
Tapi ketakutan.

32
00:01:06,880 --> 00:01:07,850
Dan seperti Daud,

33
00:01:08,080 --> 00:01:09,810
kamu tak perlu jadi yang terbesar.

34
00:01:10,100 --> 00:01:11,810
Kamu hanya perlu percaya.

